Current Dev Position: YP 2.6 M2.

Next Deadline: YP 2.6 M2 Build Target is July 16, 2018


SWAT Team Rotation:

=B7         SWAT lead is currently: Paul

=B7         SWAT team rotation: Paul -> Tracy on July 20, 2018

=B7         SWAT team rotation: Tracy -> Amanda on July 27, 2018

=B7         https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_Build_Failure_Swat_Tea=
m


Key Status/Updates:

=B7         YP 2.6 M1 was released on July 9th.

=B7         YP 2.3.4 should release shortly.

=B7         QA reports for 2.2.4 should be due this week.

=B7         Patch merging for 2.6 M2 is in progress. We=92ll likely aim to =
get oe-selftest parallelisation merged and most of the current -next patchs=
et.

=B7         Master took ~30 patches over the past week with patch review/te=
sting pending on around 50 more.

=B7         The feature list for 2.6 is becoming more specific now and at a=
 high level the current intent is:

o    Gcc 8.X

o    oe-selfest paralelisation

o    Autobuilder rework to new buildbot with testing efficiency improvement=
s

o    Automation of current manual QA testing

o    Python profile guided optimisation (pgo)

o    Inter-multiconfig dependencies

o    Sstate hash equivalence server/implementation for improved sstate reus=
e

o    Standardised OE Layer index client library in bitbake

o    Toaster for use as a configuration tool extension/enhancements

=B7         Patches for oe-selftest are on the mailing list. There was a lo=
nger discussion of the different options and implementation details which w=
as sent to the openembedded-architecture mailing list.

=B7         Thanks to the few people who took on unassigned bugs. There are=
 still plenty there if anyone else is interested in helping!


Planned Releases for YP 2.6:

=B7         YP 2.6 M2 Build Target is July 16, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M2 Release Target is July 27, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M3 Build Target is Aug. 27, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M3 Release Target is Sept. 7, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M4 Build Target is Oct. 1, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M4 Release Target is Oct. 26, 2018


Planned upcoming dot releases:

=B7         YP 2.2.4 (Morty) rc1 is built and in QA see https://wiki.yoctop=
roject.org/wiki/2.2_QA_Status it is at 100% complete, the final report shou=
ld be published shortly.

=B7         YP 2.5.1 (Sumo) will be targeted after YP 2.6 M2 is done.

=B7         YP 2.4.4 (Rocko) will be targeted after YP 2.6 M4 is done.


Tracking Metrics:

=B7         WDD 2646 (last week 2646) (https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/charts=
/combo.html)

=B7         Poky Patch Metrics

o    Total patches found: 1628 (last week 1628)

o    Percentage of patches in the Pending State: 762 (47%) [last week 761 (=
47%)]


